        {
          "name": "pqs:context",
          "value": "Core asset of this Bitcoin library: ECDSA over secp256k1, quantum-unsafe under Shor. NewSignature() double-SHA256s the raw transaction then signs with secp256k1.Sign using a nonce from newNonce() (math/rand — see ALG-7d1fdc12) and verifies in-function; NewPublicKey() derives uncompressed public keys. Provider is toxeus/go-secp256k1, a cgo wrapper around bitcoin/c-secp256k1. The code is changeable here, but the curve and signature scheme are fixed by Bitcoin consensus rules — replaceable only eco"
